      "content": "Here's a possible microcopy message for the situation you described:\n\n\"We're sorry to let you down. Your transfer to [recipient] failed due to insufficient funds. Please review your account balance to make sure you have enough funds to complete the transaction.\"\n\nThis message is clear, concise, and professional, avoiding any language that might be perceived as insensitive or distracting from the error itself. It also doesn't mention the sentiment score explicitly, which helps to avoid giving the wrong impression.",
